note.semantics:
Gluten Normalization Function:
                        0) No – Ingredients contain wheat and those ingredients can’t be modified;
                        1) Intolerant – Ingredients can be modified to remove wheat, rye, or barley
                            (cross-contamination free environment is N/A);
                        2) Celiac - Ingredients can be modified to remove wheat, rye, or barley;
                            prepared in cross-contamination free environment;
                        3) Allergy - Ingredients can be modified to remove wheat; prepared in
                            cross-contamination free environment;
                        4) All – No ingredients contain wheat, rye, or barley; prepared in
                            cross-contamination free environment
